ite","kjv":"Habaiah.","count":2},"H2253":{"lemma":"חֶבְיוֹן","xlit":"chebyôwn","pron":"kheb-yone'","from":"from H2247 (חָבָה);","def":"a concealment","kjv":"hiding.","count":1},"H2254":{"lemma":"חָבַל","xlit":"châbal","pron":"khaw-bal'","from":"a primitive root;","def":"to wind tightly (as a rope), i.e. to bind; specifically, by a pledge; figuratively, to pervert, destroy; also to writhe in pain (especially of parturition)","kjv":"[idiom] at all, band, bring forth, (deal) corrupt(-ly), destroy, offend, lay to (take a) pledge, spoil, travail, [idiom] very, withhold.","count":27},"H2255":{"lemma":"חֲבַל","xlit":"chăbal","pron":"khab-al'","from":"(Aramaic) corresponding to H2254 (חָבַל);","def":"to ruin","kjv":"destroy, hurt.","count":6},"H2256":{"lemma":"חֶבֶל","xlit":"chebel","pron":"kheh'-bel","from":"or חֵבֶל; from H2254 (חָבַל);","def":"a rope (as twisted), especially a measuring line; by implication, a district or inheritance (as measured); or a noose (as of cords); figuratively, a company (as if tied together); also a throe (especially of parturition); also ruin","kjv":"band, coast, company, cord, country, destruction, line, lot, pain, pang, portion, region, rope, snare, sorrow, tackling.","count":62},"H2257":{"lemma":"חֲבַל","xlit":"chăbal","pron":"khab-al'","from":"(Aramaic) from H2255 (חֲבַל);","def":"harm (personal or pecuniary)","kjv":"damage, hurt.","count":3},"H2258":{"lemma":"חֲבֹל","xlit":"chăbôl","pron":"khab-ole'","from":"or (feminine) חֲבֹלָה; from H2254 (חָבַל);","def":"a pawn (as security for debt)","kjv":"pledge.","count":4},"H2259":{"lemma":"חֹבֵל","xlit":"chôbêl","pron":"kho-bale'","from":"active participle from H2254 (חָבַל) (in the sense of handling ropes);","def":"a sailor","kjv":"pilot, shipmaster.","count":5},"H2260":{"lemma":"חִבֵּל","xlit":"chibbêl","pron":"khib-bale'","from":"from H2254 (חָבַל) (in the sense of furnished with ropes);","def":"a mast","kjv":"mast.","count":1},"H2261":{"lemma":"חֲבַצֶּלֶת","xlit":"chăbatstseleth","pron":"khab-ats-tseh'-leth","from":"of uncertain derivation;","def":"probably meadow-saffron","kjv":"rose.","count":2},"H2262":{"lemma":"חֲבַצַּנְיָה","xlit":"Chăbatstsanyâh","pron":"khab-ats-tsan-yaw'","from":"of uncertain derivation;","def":"Chabatstsanjah, a Rechabite","kjv":"Habazaniah.","count":1},"H2263":{"lemma":"חָבַק","xlit":"châbaq","pron":"khaw-bak'","from":"a primitive root;","def":"to clasp (the hands or in embrace)","kjv":"embrace, fold.","count":13},"H2264":{"lemma":"חִבֻּק","xlit":"chibbuq","pron":"khib-book'","from":"from H2263 (חָבַק);","def":"a clasping of the hands (in idleness)","kjv":"fold.","count":2},"H2265":{"lemma":"חֲבַקּוּק","xlit":"Chăbaqqûwq","pron":"khab-ak-kook'","from":"by reduplication from H2263 (חָבַק); embrace;","def":"Chabakkuk, the prophet","kjv":"Habakkuk.","count":2},"H2266":{"lemma":"חָבַר","xlit":"châbar","pron":"khaw-bar'","from":"a primitive root;","def":"to join (literally or figuratively); specifically (by means of spells) to fascinate","kjv":"charm(-er), be compact, couple (together), have fellowship with, heap up, join (self, together), league.","count":29},"H2267":{"lemma":"חֶבֶר","xlit":"cheber","pron":"kheh'-ber","from":"from H2266 (חָבַר);","def":"a society; also a spell","kjv":"[phrase] charmer(-ing), company, enchantment, [idiom] wide.","count":4},"H2268":{"lemma":"חֶבֶר","xlit":"Cheber","pron":"kheh'-ber","from":"the same as H2267 (חֶבֶר); community;","def":"Cheber, the name of a Kenite and of three Israelites","kjv":"Heber.","count":11},"H2269":{"lemma":"חֲבַר","xlit":"chăbar","pron":"khab-ar'","from":"(Aramaic) from a root corresponding to H2266 (חָבַר);","def":"an associate","kjv":"companion, fellow.","count":6},"H2270":{"lemma":"חָבֵר","xlit":"châbêr","pron":"khaw-bare'","from":"from H2266 (חָבַר);","def":"an associate","kjv":"companion, fellow, knit together.","count":12},"H2271":{"lemma":"חַבָּר","xlit":"chabbâr","pron":"khab-bawr'","from":"from H2266 (חָבַר);","def":"a partner","kjv":"companion.","count":1},"H2272":{"lemma":"חֲבַרְבֻּרָה","xlit":"chăbarburâh","pron":"khab-ar-boo-raw'","from":"by reduplication from H2266 (חָבַר);","def":"a streak (like a line), as on the tiger","kjv":"spot.","count":1},"H2273":{"lemma":"חַבְרָה","xlit":"chabrâh","pron":"khab-raw'","from":"(Aramaic) feminine of H2269 (חֲבַר);","def":"an associate","kjv":"other.","count":1},"H2274":{"lemma":"חֶבְרָה","xlit":"chebrâh","pron":"kheb-raw'","from":"feminine of H2267 (חֶבֶר);","def":"association","kjv":"company.","count":1},"H2275":{"lemma":"חֶבְרוֹן","xlit":"Chebrôwn","pron":"kheb-rone'","from":"from H2267 (חֶבֶר); seat of association;","def":"Chebron, a place in Palestine, also the name of two Israelites","kjv":"Hebron.","count":71},"H2276":{"lemma":"חֶבְרוֹנִי","xlit":"Chebrôwnîy","pron":"kheb-ro-nee'","from":"or חֶבְרֹנִי; patronymically from H2275 (חֶבְרוֹן);","def":"Chebronite (collectively), an inhabitant of Chebron","kjv":"Hebronites.","count":6},"H2277":{"lemma":"חֶבְרִי","xlit":"Chebrîy","pron":"kheb-ree'","from":"patronymically from H2268 (חֶבֶר);","def":"a Chebrite (collectively) or descendants of Cheber","kjv":"Heberites.","count":1},"H2278":{"lemma":"חֲבֶרֶת","xlit":"chăbereth","pron":"khab-eh'-reth","from":"feminine of H2270 (חָבֵר);","def":"a consort","kjv":"companion.","count":1},"H2279":{"lemma":"חֹבֶרֶת","xlit":"chôbereth","pron":"kho-beh'-reth","from":"feminine active participle of H2266 (חָבַר);","def":"a joint","kjv":"which coupleth, coupling.","count":4},"H2280":{"lemma":"חָבַשׁ","xlit":"châbash","pron":"khaw-bash'","from":"a primitive root;","def":"to wrap firmly (especially a turban, compress, or saddle); figuratively, to stop, to rule","kjv":"bind (up), gird about, govern, healer, put, saddle, wrap about.","count":33},"H2281":{"lemma":"חָבֵת","xlit":"châbêth","pron":"khaw-bayth'","from":"from an unused root probably meaning to cook (compare H4227 (מַחֲבַת));","def":"something fried, probably a griddle-cake","kjv":"pan.","count":1},"H2282":{"lemma":"חַג","xlit":"chag","pron":"khag","from":"or חָג; from H2287 (חָגַג);","def":"a festival, or a victim therefor","kjv":"(solemn) feast (day), sacrifice, solemnity.","count":62},"H2283":{"lemma":"חָגָא","xlit":"châgâʼ","pron":"khaw-gaw'","from":"from an unused root meaning to revolve (compare H2287 (חָגַג));","def":"properly, vertigo, i.e. (figuratively) fear","kjv":"terror.","count":1},"H2284":{"lemma":"חָגָב","xlit":"châgâb","pron":"khaw-gawb'","from":"of uncertain derivation;","def":"a locust","kjv":"locust.","count":5},"H2285":{"lemma":"חָגָב","xlit":"Châgâb","pron":"khaw-gawb'","from":"the same as H2284 (חָגָב); locust;","def":"Chagab, one of the Nethinim","kjv":"Hagab.","count":1},"H2286":{"lemma":"חֲגָבָא","xlit":"Chăgâbâʼ","pron":"khag-aw-baw'","from":"or חֲגָבָה; feminine of H2285 (חָגָב); locust;","def":"Chagaba or Chagabah, one of the Nethinim","kjv":"Hagaba, Hagabah.","count":2},"H2287":{"lemma":"חָגַג","xlit":"châgag","pron":"khaw-gag'","from":"a primitive root (compare H2283 (חָגָא), H2328 (חוּג));","def":"properly, to move in acircle, i.e. (specifically) to march in asacred procession, to observe afestival; by implication, to be giddy","kjv":"celebrate, dance, (keep, hold) a (solemn) feast (holiday), reel to and fro.","count":16},"H2288":{"lemma":"חֲגָו","xlit":"chăgâv","pron":"khag-awv'","from":"from an unused root meaning to take refuge;","def":"a rift in rocks","kjv":"cleft.","count":3},"H2289":{"lemma":"חָגוֹר","xlit":"châgôwr","pron":"khaw-gore'","from":"from H2296 (חָגַר);","def":"belted","kjv":"girded with.","count":1},"H2290":{"lemma":"חֲגוֹר","xlit":"chăgôwr","pron":"khag-ore'","from":"or חֲגֹר; and (feminine) חֲגוֹרָה; or חֲגֹרָה; from H2296 (חָגַר);","def":"a belt (for the waist)","kjv":"apron, armour, gird(-le).","count":8},"H2291":{"lemma":"חַגִּי","xlit":"Chaggîy","pron":"khag-ghee'","from":"from H2287 (חָגַג); festive","def":"Chaggi, an Israelite; also (patronymically) a Chaggite, or descendant of the same","kjv":"Haggi, Haggites.","count":3},"H2292":{"lemma":"חַגַּי","xlit":"Chaggay","pron":"khag-gah'-ee","from":"from H2282 (חַג); festive;","def":"Chaggai, a Hebrew prophet","kjv":"Haggai.","count":11},"H2293":{"lemma":"חַגִּיָּה","xlit":"Chaggîyâh","pron":"khag-ghee-yaw'","from":"from H2282 (חַג) and H3050 (יָהּ); festival of Jah;","def":"Chaggijah, an Israelite","kjv":"Haggiah.","count":1},"H2294":{"lemma":"חַגִּית","xlit":"Chaggîyth","pron":"khag-gheeth'","from":"feminine of H2291 (חַגִּי); festive;","def":"Chaggith, a wife of David","kjv":"Haggith.","count":5},"H2295":{"lemma":"חׇגְלָה","xlit":"Choglâh","pron":"khog-law'","from":"of uncertain derivation; probably a partridge;","def":"Choglah, an Israelitess","kjv":"Hoglah. See also H1031 (בֵּית חׇגְלָה).","count":4},"H2296":{"lemma":"חָגַר","xlit":"châgar","pron":"khaw-gar'","from":"a primitive root;","def":"to gird on (as a belt, armor, etc.)","kjv":"be able to put on, be afraid, appointed, gird, restrain, [idiom] on every side.","count":44},"H2297":{"lemma":"חַד","xlit":"chad","pron":"khad","from":"abridged from H259 (אֶחָד);","def":"one","kjv":"one.","count":1},"H2298":{"lemma":"חַד","xlit":"chad","pron":"khad","from":"(Aramaic) corresponding to H2297 (חַד);","def":"as card. one; as article single; as an ordinal, first; adverbially, at once","kjv":"a, first, one, together.","count":14},"H2299":{"lemma":"חַד","xlit":"chad","pron":"khad","from":"from H2300 (חָדַד);","def":"sharp","kjv":"sharp.","count":4}}